          "path": "_m/w/s/j/6/former-tait-co-merchant-house-wp/1.jpg",
          "filename": "原英商德記洋行-1.jpg",
          "caption": "The building sitting on the north and facing south comes in three floors and the main floor is set right in its center. The first floor used to be the dormitories for the staff; there’s a hall way in the middle and three rooms on both of its sides. The second floor has a similar interior design to the first one. The handrails, on the other hand, are painted with green glaze vases. Plus the white walls, the building has totally different features from usual residential houses in Anping.",
